        "en": "Does Balanced Dog Grooming offer hand-stripping for wire-haired dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers specifically highlight hand-stripping services for wire-haired breeds, noting thorough deshedding and coat shaping."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the salon handle nervous or anxious dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize that staff are gentle, patient, and attentive, using individualized spaces that help calm shy and reactive dogs."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are groomers able to handle thick, double-coated breeds?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients report excellent deshedding and grooming results for heavy-coated breeds such as Samoyeds, Huskies, and Golden Doodles."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is mobile grooming service available?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers mention utilizing the salon's convenient mobile grooming option in addition to their Westside facility."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
